**In `.env`**:
This is where you store your sensitive "secrets" (like your MongoDB link). Use a `KEY=VALUE` format:
text
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://dishapirodiya_db_user:Disha@28@cluster.mongodb.net/mydatabase
```

*Important*: After creating these, your git add . command will finally work correctly because Git will see the .gitignore and skip the massive node_modules folder.
